{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7d0a1e8e7ba881c34bc8218cc126f56e6d005bab4b593fdd701285df9bc562fd","ja":"紬のクイズ対策","zh":"紬的答题准备","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1dd712782af10a9a8a8d78c1193b492372121ef72230384b6a00f6abfff95d72","ja":"本日はクラシックコンサートにご一緒させていただき、\nありがとうございました！","zh":"今天能与您一同参加古典音乐会，\n非常感谢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"98d1e10c23e5e04fb30b7dbf5927aa02f79ec91a7c0c8126273ea6a4470600c4","ja":"私の方こそ、一緒に行けて楽しかったわ♪\nでもせっかくのお休みなのに、よかったの？","zh":"我这边才是，能一起去很开心哦♪\n不过难得的休息日，这样真的好吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"412cbf47d1781bd2a91513ec78f949ff39fc0e825c54fc8450b025d8eb531da8","ja":"はい。本番で質問の答えを合わせるには、\nもっと桜守さんと交流を深める必要があるかと。","zh":"是的。为了在正式演出中能答出一致的答案，\n我觉得有必要和樱守小姐进一步加深交流。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5900016c74ab6d791b62cb9f1a5f083a094ec84eafd1a9ff3800e5ee6c9dd57b","ja":"先日は私の趣味にお付き合いいただいたので、\n今度は桜守さんの趣味を体験できればと思いました。","zh":"前几天承蒙您陪我体验了我的爱好，\n所以这次我想着，要是也能体验一下樱守小姐的爱好就好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b02f3b80ba797bb50b035a7576beafafa43615d7f4cd007a590f18d3a0bfb15c","ja":"それにコンサート自体も、きちんと満喫できました。\n特に2番目の曲などはとても素敵で。","zh":"而且音乐会本身也尽情享受到了。\n尤其是第2首曲子，真的很棒。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4e6d36bf6704a6e5c0d7ef75af7973939fd91b6fb82065b5a160b4ee77421ee0","ja":"あっ、ブラームスね？\n私も重厚な音に圧倒されちゃった♪","zh":"啊，是勃拉姆斯对吧？\n我也被那厚重的音乐震撼到了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"afb0112c9f2b30a5118c9bf6e64703be72ebf56516be532eca5241b35192e6f3","ja":"そうでしたか！　では桜守さんも、\n本日のプログラムの中ではあの曲が一番良いと？","zh":"是这样吗！那么樱守小姐也觉得，\n今天节目单里那首曲子最棒吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9287b96d4f2dd30498c40cb0d66509988356a654145fac10b416116d2ad57c9b","ja":"えっ！　そうね……私はその次の、モーツァルトの\n柔らかな旋律が一番印象に残ってるかしら……。","zh":"咦！说的也是呢……我印象最深的，\n大概是接下来的莫扎特那柔和的旋律吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5a44a74f99151a518c5df5a452fc7360d178593322600f9a37b3f7b624c123da","ja":"はっ……！　や、やはり意見は合わないのでしょうか？\nこのままでは、不仲デュオと噂されて……！？","zh":"啊……！果、果然还是合不来吗？\n这样下去，会被传成不和组合的……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5be09b528636db84ba1046dfd6cdf88bf0976c332f1dc0bcd1d85be725769680","ja":"（う～ん……。紬ちゃん、ちょっと考えすぎちゃってる\nかも。答えを合わせることなんかより……）","zh":"（唔～……小紬可能有点想太多了。\n比起去对齐答案什么的……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"187526f53035cdcd20c240670173c8d23a60886a3472328e13c35518e03ff65d","ja":"ねえ、紬ちゃん。素敵なデュオになるためには、\nもっと大事なことがあるんじゃないかしら？","zh":"呐，紬。要想成为绝妙的双人组合，\n是不是还有更重要的事情呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"62b7fa41200cbf358b76ebeda04a7c45aebad46d2e193d94e4250c9b70dc94d0","ja":"さっきのコンサートだって、いろんな個性の音色が\nひとつになって素敵なハーモニーを奏でていたんだし。","zh":"刚才那场音乐会也是，各种各样的个性音色\n融为一体，演奏出了美妙的和声。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1246.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"55e94c4146dc65b3f11715b9fc481d8d0f30b83508575e7552acc150876463c7","ja":"いろんな個性がひとつに……あっ！\nもしかして、桜守さんがおっしゃりたいのって……！","zh":"形形色色的个性融为一体……啊！\n难道说，樱守小姐想表达的是……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
